{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>深水埗發現受傷動物。據了解，今日（18日）凌晨1時許，兩人先後經過大埔道338號一個油站對開時，發現一隻野猴口吐白泡，於是報案求助和通知愛協，人員接獲通知到場，惟野猴爬樹離開。</p><figure><img alt=\"深水埗大埔道338號一個油站對開發現一隻野猴口吐白泡。（Google街景截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188359073288949760921530.jpeg/accu_mYzvHwhuzYyxIdPjIJCPA4H0gWtwZYS9sGWEvY\"/><figcaption>深水埗大埔道338號一個油站對開發現一隻野猴口吐白泡。（Google街景截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T21:58:26.073810+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T21:23:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T00:57:36.846875+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T21:57:33.684584+00:00","content_hash":"ca89ac217bce3dc904f1efad17aa31a54dbb26ac68f04c12aa1a56b8ceab59cf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}